---
source: crates/instrukt-cli/tests/cases/editor-schemas.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8(bytes).unwrap()"
---
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "instrukt.yaml (project layer)",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 1,
      "description": "The schema version this document is written in; `instrukt config init` writes the current one, an older document is converted and a newer one refused."
    },
    "project": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "requires": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "enum": [
          "blueprint",
          "todos",
          "events",
          "history"
        ]
      }
    },
    "board": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "const": false
        },
        {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9-]+/[0-9]*[1-9][0-9]*$"
        }
      ]
    },
    "github": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "approvers": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "repository": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "approvals": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "prd": {
          "enum": [
            "human",
            "peer"
          ]
        },
        "task": {
          "enum": [
            "human",
            "peer"
          ]
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "workflow": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "modules": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "blueprint": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "todos": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "events": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "history": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "events": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "watch": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "remote": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "ref": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "remote",
              "ref"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "webhooks": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Inbound event sources, keyed by event domain (`[a-z][a-z0-9_]*`); each declared domain is served at `/hooks/inbound/project/<slug>/<domain>`, and a delivery's event type is `<domain>.<name>`.",
      "propertyNames": {
        "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$"
      },
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "secret"
        ],
        "description": "One event source, under its event domain: how its deliveries are verified and where each one's event name comes from.",
        "properties": {
          "secret": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^\\$\\{[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\}$",
            "description": "The signing secret every delivery is verified against; an exact ${NAME} reference into the machine's secrets file `~/.instrukt/secrets.env`, its value written with `instrukt secrets set <NAME>`"
          },
          "previous_secret": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^\\$\\{[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\}$",
            "description": "The signing secret being rotated out, which verifies too until it is removed; an exact ${NAME} reference into the machine's secrets file `~/.instrukt/secrets.env`, its value written with `instrukt secrets set <NAME>`"
          },
          "verify": {
            "enum": [
              "native",
              "github",
              "hmac-sha256"
            ],
            "default": "native",
            "description": "The verification scheme: `native` (`X-Hook-Signature`), `github` (`X-Hub-Signature-256` and GitHub's normalizer) or `hmac-sha256` (the declared `header`); never an unsigned fallback."
          },
          "header": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[!#$%&'*+.^_`|~0-9A-Za-z-]+$",
            "description": "The HTTP header carrying the signature; required with `verify: hmac-sha256` and refused with the other schemes."
          },
          "state": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$"
            },
            "description": "Event names, without the domain, that are external state rather than occurrences; requires `subject_from`."
          },
          "subject_from": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "The dotted payload field whose nonempty string or number qualifies the source's subject for its state names."
          },
          "name_from": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "The top-level JSON field whose string value names each delivery's event, normalized to the event-name grammar; exclusive with `name` and with `verify: github`."
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*)*$",
            "description": "A fixed event name for every delivery; exclusive with `name_from` and with `verify: github`."
          }
        },
        "allOf": [
          {
            "if": {
              "required": [
                "state"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "state": {
                  "minItems": 1
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "required": [
                "subject_from"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "required": [
                "name",
                "name_from"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "required": [
                "verify"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "verify": {
                  "const": "github"
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "not": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "required": [
                      "name"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "required": [
                      "name_from"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "required": [
                "verify"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "verify": {
                  "const": "hmac-sha256"
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "required": [
                "header"
              ]
            },
            "else": {
              "not": {
                "required": [
                  "header"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "ci": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "dependency_branch_prefixes": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "pattern": "\\S"
          }
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "review": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "automatic": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "regenerable": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1
      }
    },
    "blueprint": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "engine": {
          "enum": [
            "graphify"
          ]
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "runner": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "autostart": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": {
                "type": "boolean"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema_version"
  ]
}
